370 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The motivation behind this project is to study the design and performance of the 6T SRAM cell, which is widely used in digital memory applications because of its high speed and low power consumption. . This project helps in understanding how a 6T SRAM cell operates and how its performance can be analyzed using Cadence Virtuoso 90nm technology for VLSI memory.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
