/P 161 0 R
/E (Previous research on SRAM mainly focuses on Static Noise Margin \(SNM\) because it is an important parameter for measuring cell stability. SNM indicates the maximum noise voltage that the SRAM cell can tolerate without changing the stored data.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
