545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (To improve power efficiency, various reduction techniques are implemented in the 6T SRAM cell. In this project, methods such as stacking effect and power gating are used to minimize leakage power without significantly affecting performance.These techniques are implemented and analyzed using Cadence simulations to observe their impact on power consumption under different operating conditions.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
