/E (Power gating is an effective technique used to reduce leakage power in CMOS circuits by disconnecting the circuit from the power supply or ground during idle conditions. This is achieved using sleep transistors, which act as switches to control the power flow. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
