/Title (The sense amplifier is used to detect and amplify the small voltage difference between bit lines during the read operation. Simulation results show that it quickly converts the small differential signal into a full logic output as seen in Fig 5.5 . This improves the speed and accuracy of the read operation. The output waveform confirms fast and clear signal amplification. Proper timing of the enable signal is important to ensure correct operation.)
