1680 0 obj
<<
/Title (In hold condition, the word line is disabled, and the SRAM cell is isolated from the bit lines. The butterfly curve obtained in this state shows the maximum separation between the inverter characteristics. The simulation results indicate that hold SNM has the highest value among all operating modes. This is because there is no disturbance from the bit lines, and the cross-coupled inverters maintain strong feedback. This confirms that the SRAM cell is most stable during the hold condition.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1675 0 R
/Next 1684 0 R
>>
endobj
